                                                                                
 Usage: python -m run_intelligence log-health [OPTIONS]                         
                                                                                
 Log a health entry with asthma symptoms, peak flow, and rescue inhaler use.    
                                                                                
 Example:     run-intelligence log-health --date 2026-05-21 --peak-flow 450     
 --asthma-symptoms 2     run-intelligence log-health --post-run-rpe 7           
 --sleep-quality 3 --verbose                                                    
 Exit codes:     0: Success     1: Database or write error     2: Invalid       
 arguments                                                                      
                                                                                
╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ --date                     TEXT                     Date (YYYY-MM-DD),       │
│                                                     defaults to today        │
│ --peak-flow                INTEGER                  Peak flow reading        │
│                                                     (L/min)                  │
│ --sleep-quality            INTEGER RANGE [1<=x<=5]  Sleep quality 1-5        │
│ --post-run-rpe             INTEGER RANGE            Post-run RPE 1-10        │
│                            [1<=x<=10]                                        │
│ --asthma-symptoms          INTEGER RANGE [0<=x<=5]  Asthma symptoms 0-5      │
│ --saba-use                                          Rescue inhaler used      │
│                                                     (true/false)             │
│ --notes                    TEXT                     Additional notes         │
│ --verbose          -v                               Show saved field values  │
│ --help                                              Show this message and    │
│                                                     exit.                    │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

